Type error [tests/errors/automap_unconsumed.x:5:11]
  |
5 | let g = f @;
  |           ^
  '@' has nothing to map over here: it marks a call argument, operator operand, or literal element to map a function over, e.g. `xs @ f` or `f(xs @)`. To make a function that maps, write `fn(xs) { xs @ f }`

